{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Broomstick Exorcist is a supernatural Beat 'em up game set in a hand-drawn 2.5D manga-esque monochromatic world. In it, you fight various ghosts and demons inspired by Asian urban myths, immersing you in a world that feels like it's ripped straight from the pages of a black-and-white\u00a0manga.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Somewhere in a corner of this world, spirits refuse to stay dead. Play as Vikka, an insomniac street sweeper who hunts demons at night with her trusty broomstick and supernatural skills. Upgrade your skills, chain your precise combos, and adapt to every battle. And when the battle peaks, Henshin! Embrace your Qareen and transform into the ultimate exorcist!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manga-esque style</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2d Hand-drawn sprites capture the mood of a black-and-white Manga-esque inspired style.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skills and combos</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgradeable skill trees from passive attributes to combo move sets. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Transform</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cHenshin!\u201d INTO STRONGER VERSION OF YOU Transform into a stronger version of yourself through \u201c<i>Qareen,</i>\u201d a spiritual double of you</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3411060?t=1751273575","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411060/6d51c9bdd360478e0209227102de38494c1b2a45/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751273575","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411060/e400692581be719d28485978aa683f530ad16a36/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751273575","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411060/e4006925